nt status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA ELECTRIC INDUSTRIAL CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HIRAMATSU KATSUHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HIRAMATSU, KATSUHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A decision unit (110) extracts for counting re-transmission requests from CRC-checked received signals outputted from a CRC check unit (107) and decides whether or not the number of continuously received re-transmission requests has reached a preset threshold value, and, if it has, instructs a timing control unit (111) to switch a transmission timing. The timing control unit (111) quickens a transmission timing based on the instruction from the decision unit (110) and sets a new transmission timing in a modulation unit (108) and a transmission RF unit (109).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Une unité décisionnelle (110) prélève des extrait de signaux émis par une unité (107) de contrôle CRC, à des fins de comptage de demandes de retransmission, et décide si le m'ombre de demandes de retransmission a atteint ou non une valeur seuil préétablie; si c'est le cas, elle commande à une unité (111) d'enclencher un minutage de transmission. L'unité (111) accélère le minutage de transmission en fonction des instructions de l'unité décisionnelle (110) et fixe un nouveau minutage de transmission à un modulateur (108) et à un émetteur RF (109).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to thi